## 🎯 Project Overview

This repository contains the complete implementation of a **single-cycle MIPS-like CPU**. The project includes:

- **CPU Design**: Complete processor architecture with arithmetic logic unit (ALU), register file, memory hierarchy, and control unit
- **Verification**: Comprehensive testbenches with multiple test scenarios covering individual instruction types and integration tests
- **Assembly Programs**: Test programs in MIPS-like assembly for validating CPU functionality
- **Synthesis**: Logic synthesis tools for implementation on silicon (SKY130 PDK)

### Key Features

✅ Single-cycle CPU architecture  
✅ 32-bit word length  
✅ 256-word instruction memory  
✅ 256-word data memory  
✅ 32 general-purpose registers  
✅ Support for R-type, I-type, and control-flow instructions  
✅ Complete test coverage with 14+ test cases  
✅ VCD waveform generation for debugging  

---

## 📁 Repository Structure

```
hardwaredev/
├── README                          # This file
├── simu/                           # Simulation scripts and outputs
│   ├── simu.sh                     # Simulation script for Xcelium
│   ├── simu_icarus.sh              # Simulation script for Icarus
│   └── simu.tcl                    # Xcelium simulation configuration
├── source/                         # Source code
│   ├── design/                     # Hardware design modules
│   │   ├── LASD/                   # Main CPU implementation (3 modules)
│   │   │   ├── mod1/               # Register file and displacer circuits
│   │   │   ├── mod2/               # ALU and arithmetic components
│   │   │   ├── mod3/               # Control unit and memory
│   │   │   └── cpu_top.v           # CPU top-level module
│   │   └── practices/              # Practice exercises and learning modules
│   │       ├── alu.v               # ALU implementation
│   │       ├── counter.v           # Counter circuits
│   │       ├── memory.v            # Memory modules
│   │       ├── register.v          # Register modules
│   │       └── [other learning modules]
│   └── verif/                      # Verification and testing
│       ├── cpu_top_test.sv         # Main testbench for CPU (SystemVerilog)
│       ├── *_test.sv/.v            # Component-level testbenches
│       └── assembly/               # Test programs
│           ├── regs.hex            # Register initialization test
│           ├── basic_swlw.hex      # Basic store/load operations
│           ├── rtype.hex           # R-type ALU operations
│           ├── fibonacci.hex       # Fibonacci calculation
│           └── [other test programs]
└── synth/                          # Synthesis tools and scripts
    ├── synth_yosys.ys              # Yosys synthesis configuration
    ├── synth_genus.tcl             # Cadence Genus synthesis config
    └── run_synth.sh                # Synthesis execution script
```

