## 🚀 Getting Started

### Prerequisites

Install required tools:

```bash
# Ubuntu/Debian
sudo apt-get install iverilog gtkwave yosys

# macOS (with Homebrew)
brew install icarus-verilog gtkwave yosys
```

### Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/hiagoairesd/hardwaredev.git
cd hardwaredev
```

### Make Scripts Executable

```bash
chmod +x simu/simu_icarus.sh
chmod +x synth/run_synth.sh
```

---

## 🔬 Simulation

### Using Icarus Verilog (Recommended for Linux/macOS)

**Run CPU simulation with test case 1 (registers):**

```bash
cd simu/
./simu_icarus.sh cpu_top
```

**Run specific test case:**

```bash
./simu_icarus.sh cpu_top +test=2    # Test 2: Store/Load
./simu_icarus.sh cpu_top +test=4    # Test 4: R-type ALU
```

**With execution trace (lightweight):**

```bash
./simu_icarus.sh cpu_top +test=4 +trace
```

**With detailed write trace:**

```bash
./simu_icarus.sh cpu_top +test=4 +trace_w
```

### Using Xcelium (Enterprise Simulator)

**Setup and run:**

```bash
cd simu/
./simu.sh cpu_top
```

**View VCD waveforms:**

```bash
gtkwave cpu_top.vcd &
```

---

## 🔨 Synthesis

### Using Yosys (Open-Source)

**Prepare synthesis script:**

```bash
chmod +x synth/run_synth.sh
```

**Run synthesis:**

```bash
cd synth/
./run_synth.sh cpu_top
```

**Output:** Generated netlist and area/timing reports

### Using Cadence Genus (Commercial)

**For licensed users:**

```bash
cd synth/
genus -f synth_genus.tcl -execute "set design_name cpu_top"
```

---

## ✅ Testing

### Quick Test Suite

```bash
# Run all 14 tests sequentially
for i in {1..14}; do
    echo "Running Test $i..."
    cd simu/
    ./simu_icarus.sh cpu_top +test=$i || echo "Test $i FAILED"
    cd ..
done
```

### Individual Component Testing

```bash
# Test ALU module
cd source/verif/
iverilog -o alu_test ../design/LASD/mod2/alu.v alu_tb.v
vvp alu_test

# Test other components
iverilog -o control_test ../design/LASD/mod3/control_unit.v control_unit_test.sv
vvp control_test
```

### Generate VCD Waveforms

All simulations automatically generate `cpu_top.vcd`:

```bash
gtkwave simu/cpu_top.vcd
```

