## 📚 References

### MIPS Instruction Set
- R-type: `funct[5:0]`, `opcode[5:0]`
- I-type: 16-bit immediate
- J-type: 26-bit jump target

### Key Signals

| Signal  |  Type    | Purpose             |
|---------|----------|---------------------|
| `clk`   | Input    | System clock        |
| `rst`   | Input    | Synchronous reset   |
| `halted`| Output   | Halt indication     |
| `pc`    | Internal | Program counter     |
| `instr` | Internal | Current instruction |

